    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enyaakaki aaibung eseremata e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee ebau olapa liopishana, netii iltung'ana loo Siraeli nkang'itie, neiturrurro iltung'ana aaku tenebo te Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 27.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki adumunye Yeshua olayioni le Yohasadak, tenebo ilapolosak le ncholuek enye, o Serubabel olayioni le Shealtiel tenebo iltung'ana lenye le sotua, neshetu ninche olperere lo lasar le Nkai e Israel, pee etum aaitayu olasar opejori te nchumata enye, anaa enaigeroki too nkitanapat e Musa ilo tung'ani le Nkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.1+NUM.28.2+NUM.28.3+NUM.28.4+NUM.28.5+NUM.28.6+NUM.28.7+NUM.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 28.1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eitasheyie apa ninche ilo perere lo lasar te ewueji enye, amu keureisho apa ninche, te nkaraki lelo tung'ana leina kop. Neitayu ninche ilasarri oopejori te nchumata enye aaitaiki Olaitoriani tadekenya o teipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 29.12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neibung ninche osirua loo lng'oborri, anaa enaigeroki, neiken te risioroto oo nkitanapat, anaa ake anaishiaakino te nkolong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Enki 28.11–29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore te siadi ina neitayuni ilasarri oopejori lianaake, ilasarri lo lapa ng'ejuk too siruai pooki gelunot to Laitoriani, o lasarri le pooki ng'ae oitayu nkishorot o lpela aisho Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ebaiki enkolong e dukuya o lapa liopishana neiteru ninche aaitayu olasar opejori aaisho Olaitoriani. Kake eton eitu eshetuni olkitamanyunoto le nkaji e Nkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eiteruaki aashet enkaji e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa eishoo apa ninche mpisai ilaguetak loo soito, o laguetak loo mbaoi, o endaa, o enaoki o eilata aaisho ile Sidon o le Turo, pee eyau iltarakua te Lebanon, aaya enaiposha, neya Yopa, te risioroto e nkishoroto nanoto apa ninche te Sairos olaiguananile Parsia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa to lari liare oetunye ninche enkaji e Nkai te Yerusalem, to lapa liare, neitobir Serubabel olayioni le Shealtiel o Yeshua olayioni le Yosadak enkiterunoto, tenebo ilkulikae alashera lenye, lelo apolosak o Lawi o pooki ooetuo Yerusalem eing'ua eyararoto. Negelu ninche Ilawi ooitabaitie ilarin tikitam neilep, pee eitasheiki esiaai enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Yeshua o layiok lenyena o ltung'ana lenye le sotua oonyikare o Kadmiel, o layiok lenyena, lelo ayiok le Yuda, neitasheiki pooki ilaisiaayiak tiatua enkaji e Nkai, tenebo ilayiok le Hanadad o Lawi, o layiok lenye, o ltung'ana lenye le sotua oonyikare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
