                  "text": "1 Int 25.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake pee eiteru ilashetak olkitamanyunoto le nkaji o Laitoriani, ore ilapolosak eishopo nkilani enye e siaai nepuonu dukuya eeta ntarumpetani, ore Ilawi lelo ayiok le Asaf neyau isaanini dapashi enye, pee eisis Olaitoriani, te risioroto eutaroto e Daudi; olaiguanani loo Siraeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.10"
            ]
